# Project Memory (forced)

`.cursor/memory/`: `project.md`, `activeContext.md`, `progress.md`, `decisions.md`, `research/`.

- Missing? Create and seed from `~/.cursor/templates/light-memory/`.
- Before non-trivial work: Read the core three.
- Write durable facts immediately; after progress update `activeContext.md` and append dated `progress.md` / `decisions.md`.
- Never store secrets. Append history; do not erase dated entries. Single system only.
